  "description": "Source-aware relief engraving with clean paper highlights, graded directional crosshatching, solid ink shadows and short carved-white accents only at the ink/paper transition. This revision protects pure-black image areas from roughness and gouge speckles, brings finer hatching into highlight/midtone areas, varies stroke pressure organically and delays heavy shadow fill to retain facial modeling. Line Spacing, Stroke Width and Hatch Angle set engraving character. Crosshatch Layers adds deeper hatching sets. Contrast and Tone Bias adapt to image exposure. Shadow Fill, Gouge Cuts and Stroke Variation control the ink mass and carving. Effect Mix blends with the original. Hatch dimensions are output pixels; assess at full export resolution.",
  "author": "Anthony Chimming",
